questions.question:
In namespace `timetable`, the Job `timetable-import` has failed.

- Find the exit code of the container that made its Pods fail and write only the number to `/home/candidate/exam/q9/exit-code.txt`.
- Create a Job `timetable-build` in the same namespace:
  - 6 successful completions, at most 3 Pods running at the same time, and every Pod gets its own completion index (0-5);
  - failed Pods are retried at most 2 times before the Job is marked failed, and the Job is also marked failed if it is still running after 4 minutes;
  - the Job is deleted automatically one day after it finishes;
  - a single container, image `busybox:1.36`, that prints exactly `timetable shard <index> built` (where `<index>` is the Pod's completion index) and exits.
- `timetable-build` must complete successfully.
